⚙️ Overview

This project automates the deployment of the BMC Control-M Agent using:

Ansible — to install, configure, and start the agent on target servers.

GitLab CI/CD — to automate validation (ansible-lint) and deployment (ansible-playbook).

Currently supported:

✅ RHEL / CentOS 7, 8, 9

🕓 Windows Server (coming soon)

